<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:70%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span>Comparison with state-of-the-art models on the miniF2F-test dataset. The notation <math alttext="\mu\pm\sigma" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S3.T1.62.62.m1.1"><semantics id="S3.T1.62.62.m1.1b"><mrow id="S3.T1.62.62.m1.1.1" xref="S3.T1.62.62.m1.1.1.cmml"><mi id="S3.T1.62.62.m1.1.1.2" xref="S3.T1.62.62.m1.1.1.2.cmml">μ</mi><mo id="S3.T1.62.62.m1.1.1.1" xref="S3.T1.62.62.m1.1.1.1.cmml">±</mo><mi id="S3.T1.62.62.m1.1.1.3" xref="S3.T1.62.62.m1.1.1.3.cmml">σ</mi></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S3.T1.62.62.m1.1c"><apply id="S3.T1.62.62.m1.1.1.cmml" xref="S3.T1.62.62.m1.1.1"><csymbol cd="latexml" id="S3.T1.62.62.m1.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S3.T1.62.62.m1.1.1.1">plus-or-minus</csymbol><ci id="S3.T1.62.62.m1.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S3.T1.62.62.m1.1.1.2">𝜇</ci><ci id="S3.T1.62.62.m1.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S3.T1.62.62.m1.1.1.3">𝜎</ci></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S3.T1.62.62.m1.1d">\mu\pm\sigma</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="S3.T1.62.62.m1.1e">italic_μ ± italic_σ</annotation></semantics></math> denotes the average accuracy <math alttext="\mu" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S3.T1.63.63.m2.1"><semantics id="S3.T1.63.63.m2.1b"><mi id="S3.T1.63.63.m2.1.1" xref="S3.T1.63.63.m2.1.1.cmml">μ</mi><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S3.T1.63.63.m2.1c"><ci id="S3.T1.63.63.m2.1.1.cmml" xref="S3.T1.63.63.m2.1.1">𝜇</ci></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S3.T1.63.63.m2.1d">\mu</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="S3.T1.63.63.m2.1e">italic_μ</annotation></semantics></math> and the standard deviation <math alttext="\sigma" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S3.T1.64.64.m3.1"><semantics id="S3.T1.64.64.m3.1b"><mi id="S3.T1.64.64.m3.1.1" xref="S3.T1.64.64.m3.1.1.cmml">σ</mi><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S3.T1.64.64.m3.1c"><ci id="S3.T1.64.64.m3.1.1.cmml" xref="S3.T1.64.64.m3.1.1">𝜎</ci></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S3.T1.64.64.m3.1d">\sigma</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="S3.T1.64.64.m3.1e">italic_σ</annotation></semantics></math>. The tags CoT and non-CoT refer to two generation modes of a unified model, each guided by a different prompt.</figcaption>
</figure>
