<section class="ltx_appendix" id="A3" lang="en">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix">
<span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>An Example of Using <span class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" id="A3.1.1" style="color:#1A0DF5;">exfalso</span> to Prove a Vacuously True Statement</h2>
<div class="ltx_para" id="A3.p1">
<p class="ltx_p" id="A3.p1.1">The following example is taken from an earlier version of CombiBench <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(Liu et al., <a class="ltx_ref" href="https://arxiv.org/html/2504.21801v2#bib.bib16" title="">2025</a>)</cite>, which has been corrected in the latest release.</p>
</div>
<div class="ltx_para ltx_noindent" id="A3.p2">
<p class="ltx_p" id="A3.p2.1"><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" id="A3.p2.1.1">Input</span>:</p>
<div class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_language_lean ltx_lstlisting ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle ltx_listing" id="A3.p2.2">
<div class="ltx_listing_data"><a download="" href="data:text/plain;base64,">⬇</a></div>
<div class="ltx_listingline" id="lstnumberx1154">
<span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" id="lstnumberx1154.1">Complete</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" id="lstnumberx1154.2"> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" id="lstnumberx1154.3">the</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" id="lstnumberx1154.4"> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" id="lstnumberx1154.5">following</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" id="lstnumberx1154.6"> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" id="lstnumberx1154.7">Lean</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" id="lstnumberx1154.8"> </span>4<span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" id="lstnumberx1154.9"> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" id="lstnumberx1154.10">code</span>:
</div>
<div class="ltx_listingline" id="lstnumberx1155">
</div>
<div class="ltx_listingline" id="lstnumberx1156">“‘<span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" id="lstnumberx1156.1">lean4</span>
</div>
<div class="ltx_listingline" id="lstnumberx1157">
<span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" id="lstnumberx1157.1">import</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space" id="lstnumberx1157.2"> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier" id="lstnumberx1157.3">Mathlib</span>
</div>
<div class="ltx_listingline" id="lstnumberx1158">
</div>
<div class="ltx_listingline" id="lstnumberx1159">
